   "properties": {},
   "title": "Start here",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## LSDub 3: Test and Learn\n**Does:** analyses a music video with no dub: shots, which can be dubbed (Triage), word timing (Align), measured lip sync (Sync QA) and a fix-it list.\n\n**Needs:** the demo pack (`python custom_nodes/comfyui-lsdub/scripts/fetch_demo.py`), or your own clip + song. CPU is fine.\n\n**Time:** about 1-3 min on the demo (first run also downloads ~3 GB of speech-to-text weights).\n\n**Change for your video:** *Load Video* (your clip), *Load Audio* x2 (the song, and its dry lead vocal if you have it), *LSDub Lyrics*. Keep *LSDub Project* mode = test_learn."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
